flowchart BT
  E["<b>DynamicInferenceEngine</b> · Megatron-LM<br/>1 per GPU · runs the model, holds the KV cache"]
  W["<b>MegatronDynamoPolicyWorker</b> · NeMo RL Ray actor<br/>1 per GPU · owns the engine, receives weights,<br/>builds the handoff engine for its role · pause / suspend / resume hooks"]
  G["<b>MegatronGeneration</b> (per engine) · NeMo RL<br/>TP×PP workers = one complete copy · one per Dynamo worker"]
  FLEET["<b>MegatronDynamoFleet</b> · NeMo RL<br/>builds the per-engine copies in refit-rank order · refit fan-out,<br/>ordered pause + pin drain · starts the endpoints · shutdown order"]
  TOP["<b>MegatronGeneration</b> (dynamo=true) · NeMo RL<br/>owns the fleet and the ManagedDynamoRuntime · routes refits to the fleet,<br/>posts rollouts to the frontend · the only client of the frontend"]
  C["<b>Coordinator</b> · Megatron-LM<br/>1 per copy · started by rank 0"]
  I["<b>InferenceClient</b> · Megatron-LM<br/>adapter's and rank 0's connection to the coordinator"]
  A["<b>Megatron adapter</b> (LLMEngine) · Megatron-LM code<br/>hosted by a dynamo.common.backend.Worker task<br/>on rank 0's actor loop (like NativeVllmEngine)"]
  RT["<b>ManagedDynamoRuntime</b> · NeMo RL<br/>etcd + NATS + frontend · wait_for_engines per role"]
  F["<b>Dynamo frontend</b> · prefill router<br/>picks a prefill and a decode worker"]
  GONE["<s>DynamoGeneration · protocols.py seam · RefitChannel<br/>adapter sidecar actor · /opt/dynamo_venv</s>"]
  E -- "lives inside" --> W
  W -- "TP×PP of them form" --> G
  G -- "N per-engine copies" --> FLEET
  FLEET -- "owned by" --> TOP
  G -- "rank 0 starts" --> C
  I -- "connects to" --> C
  A -- "uses" --> I
  W -- "rank 0 hosts" --> A
  TOP -- "starts" --> RT
  RT -- "owns" --> F
  A -- "registers prefill-0 / decode-0 with" --> F
  style E fill:#fdf5e0,stroke:#d4a843
